{"id":"03c99436575af9c5","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-thm-forcing-dominating.md","title":"Dominating Forcing","display":"thm-forcing-dominating — Dominating Forcing","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-forcing-dominating","aliases":["58-thm-forcing-dominating"],"display":"thm-forcing-dominating — Dominating Forcing","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[58-df-finite-sequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-forcing-dominating"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-forcing-dominating</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-forcing-dominating — Dominating Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md\">../batch06/58-df-ctm.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic.md\">../batch16/58-df-generic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76dde059f166d3e6\" href=\"?note=76dde059f166d3e6\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md\">../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"58-df-finite-sequence\">58-df-finite-sequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,\\mathbb D,\\le_{\\mathbb D},G,d_G\\in V\">\\(M,N,\\mathbb D,\\le_{\\mathbb D},G,d_G\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> is the set-coded background theory</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinSeq}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinSeq}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}dominating}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathbb D=\n\\{\\langle s,f\\rangle\\in M:\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\le_{\\mathbb D}=\n\\Bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle\\langle t,g\\rangle,\\langle s,f\\rangle\\bigr\\rangle\n\\in\\mathbb D\\times\\mathbb D:\\\ns\\subseteq t\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(f(n)\\leq g(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16em}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\;\n(f(n)\\leq t(n))\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,\\mathbb D,\\le_{\\mathbb D},M)\n\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,\\mathbb D,G)\\\\\n&amp;\\land d_G=\\bigcup\\{s:\\exists f\\in V\\;(\\langle s,f\\rangle\\in G)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{Function}(d_G,\\omega,\\omega)\\land d_G\\in N\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{2em}\\land\\forall f\\in M\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\to\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\n(n\\leq m\\to f(m)\\leq d_G(m))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}dominating}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathbb D=\n\\{\\langle s,f\\rangle\\in M:\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\le_{\\mathbb D}=\n\\Bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle\\langle t,g\\rangle,\\langle s,f\\rangle\\bigr\\rangle\n\\in\\mathbb D\\times\\mathbb D:\\\ns\\subseteq t\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(f(n)\\leq g(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16em}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\;\n(f(n)\\leq t(n))\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,\\mathbb D,\\le_{\\mathbb D},M)\n\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,\\mathbb D,G)\\\\\n&amp;\\land d_G=\\bigcup\\{s:\\exists f\\in V\\;(\\langle s,f\\rangle\\in G)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{Function}(d_G,\\omega,\\omega)\\land d_G\\in N\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{2em}\\land\\forall f\\in M\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\to\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\n(n\\leq m\\to f(m)\\leq d_G(m))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The extension is represented by the set variable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> and the canonical predicate; no undefined term <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[G]\">\\(M[G]\\)</span> remains.  Eventual domination is expanded in the conclusion rather than hidden behind <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq^*\">\\(\\leq^*\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Hechler forcing is c.c.c. and adds a dominating real, so c.c.c. forcing can change cardinal characteristics such as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak d\">\\(\\mathfrak d\\)</span>; neither of the former preservation remarks was valid.</li>\n<li>The forcing carrier is the Hechler poset computed inside the CTM: conditions are restricted to pairs belonging to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.  Using every ambient function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span> would make <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb D\\notin M\">\\(\\mathbb D\\notin M\\)</span> and render the sourced genericity premise impossible.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-generic.md","status":"resolved","id":"545853811ce0a4b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md","status":"resolved","id":"76dde059f166d3e6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,N,\\mathbb D,\\le_{\\mathbb D},G,d_G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CTM}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinSeq}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}dominating}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC})\\\\\n&\\land\\mathbb D=\n\\{\\langle s,f\\rangle\\in M:\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\le_{\\mathbb D}=\n\\Bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle\\langle t,g\\rangle,\\langle s,f\\rangle\\bigr\\rangle\n\\in\\mathbb D\\times\\mathbb D:\\\ns\\subseteq t\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(f(n)\\leq g(n))\\\\\n&\\hspace{16em}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\;\n(f(n)\\leq t(n))\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,\\mathbb D,\\le_{\\mathbb D},M)\n\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,\\mathbb D,G)\\\\\n&\\land d_G=\\bigcup\\{s:\\exists f\\in V\\;(\\langle s,f\\rangle\\in G)\\}\\\\\n&\\to\\mathrm{Function}(d_G,\\omega,\\omega)\\land d_G\\in N\\\\\n&\\hspace{2em}\\land\\forall f\\in M\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\to\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\n(n\\leq m\\to f(m)\\leq d_G(m))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"M[G]","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak d","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb D\\notin M","display":false}],"bytes":2357,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4158","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-thm-forcing-dominating.md|58-thm-forcing-dominating]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["66d43bb76d055059","545853811ce0a4b6","76dde059f166d3e6","36d7463d215be751","f4bf86f66c1444da"]}